<div class="rte page-content">
<h2><em><strong>Who are we?</strong></em></h2>
<p>RZCrewGarage.com was founded in 2012 in Singapore. This website was built to ensure that gearheads around the world could buy their favourite automotive products at best prices.<br/><br/></p>
<h2><strong>Authenticity guaranteed:<br/></strong></h2>
<p>All products sold by RZ Crew Clone are guaranteed to be 100% authentic and genuine. All of the products listed on our site are manufactured to the highest of quality standards. If you have any concerns over product authenticity, quality or lead times please don't hesitate to <a href="https://rzcrewgarage.com/pages/contact-us"><span class="links">contact us</span></a>.<br/><br/>RZ Crew Clone has a proud and ethical history of only ever selling authentic and genuine products from the top brands and manufacturers. These are the brands that invest heavily into developing new products for our cars in order to increase your driving experience. Without these brands and their forward-thinking approach we'd simply have no performance parts to add to our cars.<br/><br/></p>
<h2><strong>Product Warranty:</strong></h2>
<p>All products sold by RZ Crew Clone are 100% warrantied following the manufacturer terms and condition back to back. For more information on warranty, please check our T&amp;C page.<br/><br/></p>
<h2><strong>Location:<br/></strong></h2>
<p>SINGAPORE (headquarters - visit only upon appointment only):<br/><br/>RZCrew Trading Pte Ltd 201628281N<br/><span>24 New Industrial Road #04-02</span><span> <br/></span><span>536210 Singapore</span><br/><br/>(Opening Hours)<br/>Monday to Friday 1pm to 6pm SGT</p>
<p>Our warehouses:</p>
<p>FRANCE:<br/>13 Rue des Rochettes,<br/>91150 Morigny-Champigny<br/><span><br/>USA:</span><br/><span>9455 NE Alderwood Rd</span><br/>Portland, Oregon 97252</p>
